briefs.build:
Backend:
- routes/platform.py: POST /calls/ingest/{provider}, signed with a per-tenant HMAC secret held in the vault.
- Creates the call via call_review.create_call with status 'awaiting_consent'. ConsentMissing blocks processing until record_consent exists for every party.
- After consent:
  - review the call;
  - draft a recap;
  - queue a follow-up email (kind 'followup', owner_user_id = rep);
  - extract CRM fields (stage, objections, next step, timeline): terminal moves go through actions.propose, other fields are suggestions.
UI: Calls.tsx ingest status and consent checklist.
Tests: tests/test_call_loop.py covers an unsigned request getting 401; no review before consent; after consent, a recap plus a pending, unsent follow-up plus a pending CRM proposal.
